+/*
+ * libkernel writes the FreeBSD-derived Orbis stat ABI.  The OpenOrbis
+ * toolchain header selected by the JDK build uses wider mode_t and nlink_t
+ * fields, shifting every field after st_mode by eight bytes.  Keep the
+ * runtime ABI explicit at this boundary rather than interpreting native
+ * output through the compiler's incompatible struct stat definition.
